# Bookora

Bookora is a **modern React web app** for browsing and discovering books.  
It features a sleek UI, search functionality, and integrates with the Google Books API.

##  Features
- Browse books by category
- Search by title/author
- Responsive UI
- Add favorites
- Authentication (if applicable)

##  Tech Stack
React | JavaScript | CSS | API

## Installation
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Shadya05/Bookora.git
cd Bookora
npm install
npm start
